AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:FOODON_03420308 "A short, thickened, fleshy part of an underground stem, as a potato: new plants develop from the buds, or eyes, that grow in the axils of the minute scale leaves of a tuber (Source: Webster's)"@en)
