# Class: obo:FOODON_03460180 (obsolete: food added)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:FOODON_03460180 obo:IAO_0000428)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000231 obo:FOODON_03460180 "\"Food added\" and its subclasses referenced existing ingredients / food products.  FoodOn uses relations like \"has ingredient\" to do the same. If needed, these relations can be annotated with proportions."@en)
