AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:FOODON_03460180 "LanguaL curation note: When not otherwise indicated in the scope note, *FOOD ADDED* factor terms are applied when the specified food is the second ingredient in order of predominance, excluding water. Always used for fillings and when the added food is part of the product name (e.g., raisin bread)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:FOODON_03460180 "obsolete: food added"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated obo:FOODON_03460180 "true"^^xsd:boolean)

